<title>USA: Providian Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Providian Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $1.22		    $1.07</p>
<p> Oper net		  117,987		  101,538</p>
<p> Shr			    1.24		     1.09</p>
<p> Net			 116,701		  102,598</p>
<p> Revs			951,094		  880,511</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Providian Corp.</p>
<p>Operating earnings exclude from net income realized investment gains and losses and related deferred acquisition cost amortization, net of taxes, and dividends on company-obligated mandatorily redeemable preferred securities of Providian LLC and Providian Bancorp-obligated mandatorily redeemable capital securities of Subsidiary Trust holding solely junior subordinated deferrable interest debentures of Providian Bancorp.</p>
<p>Operating earnings per common share exclude from net income realized investment gains and losses and related deferred acquisition cost amortization, net of taxes.</p>
</text>
